        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions STR2SMTSBR, Solid Brass Sutter Ruler Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA very modern pull, the Mitered Sutter Solid Brass Pull is great for contemporary doors both around the home and in commercial settings. It is versatile: it can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. This means the Solid Brass Ruler Pull can be used on glass storefront doors, as a refrigerator pull, and certainly as a front door handle. Since it is made out of brass, it is available in a huge selection of finishes, so you can choose the one that suits your application. Select a 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch pull below.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Sutter Series 2 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-STR02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262331\"><b>First Impressions STR2SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>STR2012SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 11-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-8/9\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>STR2024SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 23-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-8/9\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>STR2036SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 35-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-8/9\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Mitered Sutter Solid Brass Pull",
                "description": "A very modern pull, the Mitered Sutter Solid Brass Pull is great for contemporary doors both around the home and in commercial settings. The Solid Brass Ruler Pull can be used on glass storefront doors, as a refrigerator pull, and certainly as a front door handle. Buy this handle in 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths at Doorware.com today.",
